#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CrowdSec resolves the AS and country itself, in the "
"{crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} parser on the machine that raised the alert. "
"The LAPI never computes them, it stores whatever the agent sent. Install "
"that parser on the reporting machine and these alerts start carrying "
"{as_name}, {as_number} and {cn}."
msgstr ""
"CrowdSec сам определяет AS и страну в парсере {crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} "
"на машине, которая создала алерт. LAPI никогда их не вычисляет, он хранит "
"то, что прислал агент. Установите этот парсер на отправляющей машине, и эти "
"алерты начнут содержать {as_name}, {as_number} и {cn}."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"CrowdSec returned as many alerts as the cap allows, so older ones are not "
